From 645557953073a32190d42bff81ecfef70d3d1332 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicholas Smith <nsmith@tenstorrent.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:13:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [bug] Preserve state slots across prefill continuation
 (opt-in)

agentic-models patch P1 (vllm-tt-plugin-prefill-state-slot-continuation.patch).

A model declaring model_capabilities['preserve_prefill_state_slots']=True keeps
a continuing chunked prefill in the device-state slot it already owns, and all
live owners are reserved before newcomers are placed (row order need not match
the slot order of the previous chunk, and prefill has no gather). Base:
m3 a09b0ef (m2 5d1785b is the same code). Without the declaration
_alloc_prefill_state_slots runs the f6fe76b body unchanged. The declaration is
validated as a boolean at platform init and at use.

Tests: the a09b0ef cases with the capability on, a capability-off case
asserting the f6fe76b slot choice, preempt/resume mid-prefill, and validation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
