diff --git a/docs/MODEL_LIFECYCLE.md b/docs/MODEL_LIFECYCLE.md
index 082cbde..709bd19 100644
--- a/docs/MODEL_LIFECYCLE.md
+++ b/docs/MODEL_LIFECYCLE.md
@@ -45,6 +45,12 @@ Device-state slots identify adapter-owned request state. A prefill row is not
 necessarily the slot that owns that request. KV page addresses and state slots
 serve different purposes; the adapter must honor both.
 
+With `preserve_prefill_state_slots=True`, continuing prefill chunks keep their
+current state slot even when their packed row changes. The plugin reserves all
+live owners before allocating slots for new requests; prefill does not move
+existing state. A decode gather can subsequently move that state through the
+explicit remap contract below.
+
 | Interface | Adapter responsibility |
 |---|---|
 | `prefill_forward(empty_slots=[...])` | Write each prefill row's state into the corresponding destination slot; preserve live state in other slots. Stateless adapters can ignore `empty_slots`. |
